(Scheme: Prime Minister's Research Fellows \(PMRF\) Scheme) Tj
T*
(Category: STUDENTS) Tj
T*
(Official Government Guidelines & Policy Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. OBJECTIVES AND OVERVIEW:) Tj
T*
(Direct admission and attractive fellowship \(Rs 70,000 to Rs 80,000 per month plus Rs 2 Lakh annual research grant\) for PhD programs at IITs, IISc, and IISERs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA:) Tj
T*
(- Resident Indian citizens who satisfy the scheme specific income and occupational criteria.) Tj
T*
(- Valid identity documentation required: Aadhaar Card, linked active bank account with Direct Benefit Transfer \(DBT\) enablement.) Tj
T*
(- Exclusion parameters: Institutional entities, constitutional post-holders, and income-tax payees of preceding financial assessment years unless explicitly covered under special state category.) Tj
T*
ET
