T*
() Tj
T*
(3. FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE & DISBURSEMENT METHODOLOGY:) Tj
T*
(- Direct Benefit Transfer \(DBT\) via Aadhaar Payment Bridge \(APB\) directly credited to verified beneficiary accounts.) Tj
T*
(- Center and State budgetary sharing ratio strictly followed \(60:40 standard, 90:10 for North Eastern and Himalayan regions\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. APPLICATION PROCESS & GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL:) Tj
T*
(- Online application via National Unified Portal \(india.gov.in\) or offline through nearest Common Service Centers \(CSC\).) Tj
T*
(- Dedicated District Grievance Redressal Committee \(DGRC\) and State Nodal Agency oversight.) Tj
T*
